en's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"7EFbmaCvOjPxC7cb3LMnvA","review_id":"ZPHMOdfChlmkEK8djv5Ydg","date":"2019-02-06T23:36:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9373739361763,"text_excerpt":"I had lunch at Café Navarre with my mom today and we really enjoyed our visit. It didn't hurt that the weather was absolutely gorgeous and there was plenty of outside seating. We went in and ordered, then found a seat on the front patio. Within minutes our Cuban sandwich and fries were ready and delivered to our table. The Cuban was everything I had hoped it would be. Tasty, tender pork, lean sliced ham, gooey Swiss cheese, tangy pickles and mustard on really delicious, crusty pressed French bread. What a hit! The fries were OK. Maybe some seasoning, or a thicker sliced potato would be nice. They were just lacking something. Our server was wonderful. She came out to check on us periodical..."},{"business_id":"7EFbmaCvOjPxC7cb3LMnvA","review_id":"T8z7gUV2QMClKFPS67zybA","date":"2016-03-13T16:16:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9336422681808472,"text_excerpt":"Finally stopped in for lunch after driving by this place a few times. We sat outside which is always a plus in my book. Their patio is really nice. I got a mimosa and the spinach artichoke panini. It was really tasty. My moms salad was huge. My dad couldn't finish his panini and fries bc there was a decent serving. My boyfriend devoured his egg po boy. We will definitely be back for brunch/lunch. The prices weren't bad at all."},{"business_id":"7EFbmaCvOjPxC7cb3LMnvA","review_id":"AG0TLkMf8pwZEBZFQbUv3A","date":"2014-04-04T19:09:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9263400435447693,"text_excerpt":"This is a very cute, neighborhood cafe. I had the most delicious catfish po-boy there. They dress it seriously, with lettuce, pickles, mayo, tomatoes, and ketchup. I was a pretty busy Friday lunch hour but the food was coming out apace, much to their credit. I see that they have alcoholic beverages and are now open for dinner. I have to check their hours and maybe stop by after work. Anyway, I'll undoubtedly be back. Friendly service, delicious food, and reasonable prices in a charming location."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"7EFbmaCvOjPxC7cb3LMnvA","photo_id":"Z0VxVeXGB_WSGuErE29QKQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Z0VxVeXGB_WSGuErE29QKQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9114776253700256},{"business_id":"7EFbmaCvOjPxC7cb3LMnvA","photo_id":"XRG_GKqnz4f1Pd3-8lIo4g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/XRG_GKqnz4f1Pd3-8lIo4g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8794007301330566},{"business_id":"7EFbmaCvOjPxC7cb3LMnvA","photo_id":"0Ig453bu6Cn4dAd7dGVkVA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/0Ig453bu6Cn4dAd7dGVkVA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8612120747566223},{"business_id":"7EFbmaCvOjPxC7cb3LMnvA","photo_id":"SmsnEU3nsNd0yAd47Hi3dQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/SmsnEU3nsNd0yAd47Hi3dQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8432137370109558}]},"notebook_case":null}
